lpractice: Pharmaceuticals secretaryCapricorn Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Send the Reply You Keep Drafting; Uttara Phalguni Moon Points to Good Advice'The Paradise' box office collection day 15 vs 'Don't Trouble The Trouble' day 7: Nani's film earns Rs 89 lakhs; worldwide gross reaches Rs 171.32 cr; Fahadh Faasil starrer collects Rs 4.41 cr India netKPSC scam candidates taken to resorts, provided with Q&A: EDWhat happened in viral video of Dodgers fan refusing ball to child? Incident explainedCorey Pavin reveals wife Lisa’s cancer ‘never went away completely’ months after her final chemotherapy sessionDaily Career Horoscope, October 09, 2026: Success, challenges, and breakthroughs; Know about your careerMalhar Patekar on father Nana Patekar's legacy: 'His achievements have made him immortal'Sagittarius Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Home First, Career Second; Uttara Phalguni Moon Puts Your Work on DisplayCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved. For reprint rights: Times Syndication ServiceFollow Us On","title":"Perfect storm: Sensex slips amid rising oil, bond yields","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/perfect-storm-sensex-slips-amid-rising-oil-bond-yields/articleshow/134803327.cms","id":92},{"content_hash":"28501631e69f713d89d60321c35c614a89e810021003713667a6b319ba7b4510","domain":"www.lemonde.fr","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:29:52.217838+00:00","final_url":"https://www.lemonde.fr/archives/article/1951/11/07/des-importateurs-yougoslaves-passent-des-contrats-avec-des-societes-francaises_2072807_1819218.html","language":"","text":"Cet article vous est offert Pour lire gratuitement cet article réservé aux abonnés, connectez-vous Se connecter Vous n'êtes pas inscrit sur Le Monde ? Inscrivez-vous gratuitement Archives Archives Archives Des importateurs yougoslaves passent des contrats avec des sociétés françaises Le Monde Publié le 07 novembre 1951 à 00h00, modifié le 07 n