​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​JD Vance Exposes H-1B Scam!: 6,000 Americans Duped; Microsoft, Wipro & TCS On Visa HitlistLatest NewsVishal Parekh on 'Mitrata': 'I didn't want to do the same Vishal that people already see on Instagram' - EXCLUSIVESupreme Court: For post-split suicide, can't always accuse ex of abetmentIIT Bombay fire: How gas leak triggered hostel flare-up, 5 injured, including 2 minorsPerfect storm: Sensex slips amid rising oil, bond yields'Tell your story': Pat Cummins' blunt response to Usman Khawaja's book on SandpapergateChris Hemsworth and Elsa Pataky helped return Tasmanian devils to mainland Australia after 3,000 years; the endangered marsupials could help restore ecosystems'Workers with AI skills in demand, but GenAI is hitting white-collar hiring'Anne Carson wins Nobel Prize in Literature: What we know about her brother, memoir ‘Nox’ and her India connectionQuote of the day by Leonardo da Vinci: \"Men of lofty genius sometimes accomplish the most when they work least, for their minds are occupied with their ideas...to which they afterwards give form.\"Patrick Mahomes and Brittany Mahomes’ Kansas City Current takes a step toward expansion with $235 million funding approvalAquarius Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Read the Fine Print on Shared Money; Uttara Phalguni Moon Opens a Hidden FileWho is Jaime Chapman’s boyfriend? All about the NRLW star’s rugby league romance'Hanuman Ansh' box office collection day 63: Vishal Chaturvedi's film earns Rs 75 lakhs; worldwide gross reaches Rs 427.43 crore; India net total stands at Rs 327.98 crore'Sigma' box office collection day 7: Jason Sanjay's film earns Rs 8.27 cr India net; Soori's film reaches Rs 100.58 cr'Drishyam 3: The Conclusion' box office collection day 7: Ajay Devgn-Tabu film earns Rs 13 crore; worldwide gross headed for Rs 400 crore markSteep margins allow room for malpractice: Pharmaceuticals secretaryCap