 with AI skills in demand, but GenAI is hitting white-collar hiring'Anne Carson wins Nobel Prize in Literature: What we know about her brother, memoir ‘Nox’ and her India connectionQuote of the day by Leonardo da Vinci: \"Men of lofty genius sometimes accomplish the most when they work least, for their minds are occupied with their ideas...to which they afterwards give form.\"Patrick Mahomes and Brittany Mahomes’ Kansas City Current takes a step toward expansion with $235 million funding approvalAquarius Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Read the Fine Print on Shared Money; Uttara Phalguni Moon Opens a Hidden FileWho is Jaime Chapman’s boyfriend? All about the NRLW star’s rugby league romance'Hanuman Ansh' box office collection day 63: Vishal Chaturvedi's film earns Rs 75 lakhs; worldwide gross reaches Rs 427.43 crore; India net total stands at Rs 327.98 crore'Sigma' box office collection day 7: Jason Sanjay's film earns Rs 8.27 cr India net; Soori's film reaches Rs 100.58 cr'Drishyam 3: The Conclusion' box office collection day 7: Ajay Devgn-Tabu film earns Rs 13 crore; worldwide gross headed for Rs 400 crore markSteep margins allow room for malpractice: Pharmaceuticals secretaryCapricorn Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Send the Reply You Keep Drafting; Uttara Phalguni Moon Points to Good Advice'The Paradise' box office collection day 15 vs 'Don't Trouble The Trouble' day 7: Nani's film earns Rs 89 lakhs; worldwide gross reaches Rs 171.32 cr; Fahadh Faasil starrer collects Rs 4.41 cr India netCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved. For reprint rights: Times Syndication ServiceFollow Us On","title":"MDR on UPI may now take effect in January 2027","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/mdr-on-upi-may-now-take-effect-in-january-2027/articleshow/134803802.cms","id":186},{"content_hash":"2b39fcb62ff4e8fbd03647ea6c598232548beb787c9555c561aaff49adf6d76b","domain":"reallygoodemails.co