-Chancellor Professor Nicholas Klomp discuss the week in politics including Australia’s involvement in the Middle East, US President Barack Obama’s announcement, the possible rise of Australia’s terror threat, Julia Gillard facing the royal commission and announcement of the deferral of a planned referendum. Terrorism Video Michelle Grattan, University of Canberra Author Michelle Grattan Professorial Fellow, University of Canberra Disclosure statement Michelle Grattan does not work for, consult, own shares in or receive funding from any company or organization that would benefit from this article, and has disclosed no relevant affiliations beyond their academic appointment. Partners University of Canberra provides funding as a member of The Conversation AU. View all partners DOI https://doi.org/10.64628/AA.px5j9gwk3","title":"VIDEO: Michelle Grattan on Australia’s involvement in the Middle East","url":"https://theconversation.com/video-michelle-grattan-on-australias-involvement-in-the-middle-east-31629","id":216},{"content_hash":"f565a66b951b7f26873409b878bc20d77f385e0eafc5f4cd29d2184914a8ef4f","domain":"prnigeria.com","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:29:21.432898+00:00","final_url":"https://i0.wp.com/prnigeria.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IMG-20250720-WA0028.jpg?fit=438%2C435&ssl=1","language":"","text":"ÿØÿà�\u0010JFIF�\u0001\u0001��\u0001�\u0001��ÿÛ�C� \u000f\u0010\u000e\u0010\u000f\u0016\u0014\u0013\u0013\u0014\u0016\"\u0018\u001a\u0018\u001a\u0018\"3 % % 3-7,),7-Q@88@Q^OJO^qeeq»»ûÿÛ�C\u0001 \u000f\u0010\u000e\u0010\u000f\u0016\u0014\u0013\u0013\u0014\u0016\"\u0018\u001a\u0018\u001a\u0018\"3 % % 3-7,),7-Q@88@Q^OJO^qeeq»»ûÿÂ�\u0011\b\u0001³\u0001¶\u0003\u0001\"�\u0002\u0011\u0001\u0003\u0011\u0001ÿÄ�\u001b�\u0001�\u0002\u0003\u0001\u0001�����������\u0005\u0006\u0001\u0003\u0004\u0002\u0007ÿÄ�\u001a\u0001\u0001�\u0003\u0001\u0001\u0001�����������\u0001\u0002\u0003\u0004\u0005\u0006ÿÚ� \u0003\u0001�\u0002\u0010\u0003\u0010��\u0001¹��������Æ3¤Üß]dÍ²È����������