aaland’s message after Man City’s explosive verdictBreaking the Monolith: Colonial Legacy, Combat Reality, and the Future of Strategic Military Leadership in the Indian ArmyDussehra gift for cane farmers in UP as SC, HC order release of Rs 2k cr in dues on hold for 30 yrsTrisha hides pendant with heart emoji in latest click with Radhika Sarathkumar, 'Karuppu' actress leaves fans guessing again'Don't particiapte in any activity': Delhi Police reach out to religious places, RWAs ahead of CJP stir\"I don’t use equipment': Milind Soman runs barefoot at 60: KNOW the surprising benefits this habit may have for his foot musclesRise and Fall 2: Karan Patel exits the show over health concerns; Kajal Raghwani, Swara Bhaskar and others get emotionalRepeat. Reinvent. Turn up the style: the festive flex is no longer a new outfit — it’s making an old one look brand newLuke Bryan bought 150 acres of Tennessee cow pasture in 2012; he turned it into a private lake, a 10,000-square-foot home and a 7,000-square-foot party barnDiabetic-friendly seeds that may help manage sugarHema Malini regrets MISSING Nana Patekar’s last call; actress says, 'Couldnt answer, I was travelling'Nora Fatehi goes full Mugler in brown and red at Paris Fashion Week 2026Nana Patekar’s death at 75 puts sudden cardiac arrest in focus: Why CPR within minutes is crucialApple may launch its first touch-screen MacBook on October 27: ReportDaily Astrology News Alert, 9 October 2026: Libra Moon and Mercury-Saturn Tension Make It a Day for Serious TalksRamayana release date advanced in India? Ranbir Kapoor and Yash starrer ditches Diwali release to debut worldwide on November 5 : ReportsCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved. For reprint rights: Times Syndication ServiceFollow Us On","title":"In 2011, an Ohio man was served foreclosure papers on his $4.5 million, 17,000-sq-ft mansion; after nearly 15 years of hearings, mediation and court fights, an eviction notice has now been approved","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2011-an-ohio-man-was-served-foreclosure-papers-on-his-4-5-million-17000-sq-ft-mansion-after-nearly-15-years-of-hearings-mediation-and-court-fights-an-eviction-notice-has-now-been-approved/articleshow/134804985.cms","id":272},{"content_hash":"a3f2cd413c0191f9a259b41b1d7ae8360ffb315a5a449d7061dc135653d7b676","domain":"www.chinadaily.com.cn","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:29:08.164630+00:00","final_url":"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202608/19/WS6a97c837e4b06d4aa055bece.html","language":"","text":"Qixi Festival: Love across the stars - Chinadaily.com.cn 635f3163a310fd2b29e7f620 WWW.CHINADAILY.COM.CN HOME VIDEO GRAPHICS POSTER PHOTOS INTERACTIVE Qixi Festival: Love across the stars Join us in celebrating the Qixi Festival. Often referred to as Chinese Valentine's Day, this cherished tradition tells the timeless love story of the Cowherd and the Weaver Girl, symbolizing the power of love and the beauty of reunion as they meet across the Milky Way. In this video, let’s witness the intricate crafts and sweet Qiaoguo pastries that embody heartfelt emotions and the threads of fate that connect us all. Let the Milky Way stand as a testament to love that grows stronger with each passing year. Explore the romantic allure of Qixi Festival and be inspired by a love story that transcends time and space. 【七夕｜星河为证，爱久弥新】 巧手牵缘，心有所属。巧果寄情，甘为君心。星河长明，爱久弥新。【AI智绘工作室】 分享到微信朋友圈 使用手机微信 “扫一扫” 即可将内容分享到我的朋友圈。 VIDEOS More Qinghai-Xizang Railway: 20 years on Dragon Boat Festival: Midsummer blessings, health all year Shangsi Festival: A poetic spring ritual Longtaitou Festival: A celebration of fresh start China's environmental code: A gift to the future Cold snow, hot growth: China's winter economy heats up 光芒，点亮每一页 On the journey to modernization Copyright 1994 - . All rights reserved. The content (including but not limited to text, photo, multimedia information, etc) published in this site belongs to China Daily Information Co (CDIC). Without writ