identPriyanka GandhiMad Sandhu MurderTN Dementia CasesWeather ForecastDelhi Airport Drone SeizedGulzar Singh CaseJaipur Live in MurderMangalore refinery blastJeff BezosJamie DimonChatGPT Teen RiskHubSpot LayoffsClaude Haiku 5.5Red Teaming AI AgentMark Zuckerberg BiohubBudget SmartPhone MarketAmazon LayoffsJeff Bezos MarsFired OpenAI ResearchersPopular CategoriesHeadlinesSports NewsBusiness NewsIndia NewsWorld NewsInternational SportsHealthBreaking NewsTravelAstrologyDeorhiTOI Young LeadersTOI Home Decor AwardsPower Creator Awards 2026The Times of India EcopreneurGold Rate TodayWeather TodaySilver Price TodayDelhi Weather TodayPetrol Price TodayDiesel Price TodayCNG Price TodayLPG Price TodayPetrol Price MumbaiFIFA 2026Is Bank Open TodayFIFA 2026 ScheduleIs Bank Open TomorrowPublic Holidays in JuneBank Holidays in JuneTrending Videos‘Not Playing This Game’: Marco Rubio Unloads On Reporter Over Kimberly Guilfoyle’s $100,000 BribeRoyal GP Murder Shock: Husband’s ‘Burglar’ Account Emerges After Hannah Cain Found DeadMusk's Team Trump Return? POTUS Resets Ties After Public Epstein Feud, Calls Him 'Modern Edison'Zohran Mamdani Grilled Over Oct. 7 Post; Reporter Asks: ‘Will You Apologize To Netanyahu?’‘Canada-EU Deal Done’: Mark Carney Slams Trump's Tariff Move In New PresserChrista HELPED Executioners? Pike Lawyers' SHOCKER Adds BIG Twist To Failed Execution MysteryRiyadh Airspace SHUT! Airlines Cancel Hundreds Of Flights After Houthis BLOW UP Saudia Airbus JetPresley Gerber’s Drug Battle Blamed For Tragic Final Chapter As Years-Long Addiction Struggle EmergeTrump-Vance Clash? POTUS Honors Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella As VP Targets Tech Giant Over H-1B VisasMen Trailer​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​ : Jessie Buckley and Rory Kinnear Starrer Men Official Trailer​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​JD Vance Exposes H-1B Scam!: 6,000 Americans Duped; Microsoft, Wipro & TCS On Visa HitlistAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor’s Warrant Win; Why His Legal Fight Is Far From OverWATCH: Trump Heckler Assaulted At Texas Rally; POTUS Immediately Reacts‘Europe Gets New F-35’: Marco Rubio Flexes NATO Power With Massive Ammo Boost | WatchDolly Parton's Family Eyes BIOPIC Amid $650 Million Estate Feud; Who Will Play The Music Icon?Germany, France Push Tougher EU China Trade Policy As Europe’s Deficit Tops €1 Billion A DaySumeet Raghavan Raises Concern Over Littering In HimachalHouthis Rock Riyadh Airport With Missiles, Threaten Global Airlines as Indian Flights Turn BackLatest NewsA CEO who was not a cyclist trained for months, then rode about 2,000 miles from Mexico to Canada in 12 days; along the route, his team raised and distributed more than $766,000 to over 70 people and organisationsStarlink entry row: Is Ambani the real boss of India, asks Elon MuskThis tiny Egyptian object was mistaken for a copper awl for a century; researchers now say its six surviving leather coils reveal a 5,300-year-old bow-powered rotary drillGST Council scraps tax officers' arrest powers, eases refund rulesNana Patekar’s death case: Goa Police registers 'unnatural death' case; to record statements of family and conduct post-mortem to establish cause of deathLeo Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Settle the Shared Bill; Uttara Phalguni Moon Steadies Your PurseCancer drug prices may fall as government plans 30% trade margin capDefence secretary talks to German envoy & Greece deputy minister to widen strategic partnershipsCancer Shani Horoscope Today, 9 October 2026: Saturn Says Back Your Belief With Effort; Uttara Phalguni Moon Sharpens Your SpeechWith Street Fighter, I finally got to play myself on screen: Vidyut JammwalNana Patekar's son Malhar reveals why actor's last rites were held on Thursday night - WATCHFrom 19 havai sepoys to a formidable air force in the world, IAF celebrates its 94-year-old glorious journeyOntario man with Stage 4 cancer won court battle after OHIP denied US treatment, then province changed the rules; doctors sought funding for US$600,000 TIL therapy in FloridaPsychology says anger may make you crave crunchy food while anxiety pushes you towards soft textures; new research links emotions to what your mouth wants to eatMhadei diversion: BJP workers march to airport ahead of K’taka CM’s arrivalAt GST meet, CM backs reforms to ease taxpayer challengesIn final public speech, Nana Patekar paid tribute to Manohar Parrikar’s humilityNana Patekar, cinema’s angry, honest man, dies at 75Copyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved. For reprint rights: Times Syndication ServiceFollow Us On","title":"In 2007, Bryan Cranston bought a California beach bungalow for $2.5 million; after rebuilding it as a 2,450-sq-ft net-zero energy home, he sold the property 14 years later for $5.45 million","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2007-bryan-cranston-bought-a-california-beach-bungalow-for-2-5-million-after-rebuilding-it-as-a-2450-sq-ft-net-zero-energy-home-he-sold-the-property-14-years-later-for-5-45-million/articleshow/134787193.cms","id":306},{"content_hash":"b9362011241ff5fa9a86d3cbd1ea6f8ecb7175790fbcee92fd506e63a9a5b574","domain":"www.theglobeandmail.com","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:29:01.139944+00:00","final_url":"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/adv/appointmentnotices/article-dr-harvey-weingarten/","language":"","text":"Dr. Harvey Weingarten, Director of the Future Talent Institute (FTI), International Business University (IBU)SUPPLIEDShareInternational Business University (IBU) is pleased to announce the appointment of Dr. Harvey Weingarten as Director of the Future Talent Institute (FTI) reinforcing IBU’s commitment to strengthening ties between higher education, workforce development and the evolving needs of employers.Dr. Weingarten is a respected Canadian higher education leader and policy thinker. His has served as President and Vice-Chancellor of the University of Calgary, President and CEO of the Higher Education Quality Council of Ontario, Principal of the Michener Institute of Education at UHN, and Provost and Vice-President Academic at McMaster University. He currently serves as a Senior Fellow at the C.D. Howe Institute.Widely recognized for his research and thought leadership on the future of post-secondary education, Dr. Weingarten has long challenged institutions to close the gap between education and employment to keep pace with a changing economy. He is well positioned to lead the FTI in delivering innovative training and upskilling models that meet employer and economic requirements.Open this photo in gallery:SUPPLIED","title":"Dr. Harvey Weingarten","url":"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/adv/appointmentnotices/article-dr-harvey-weingarten/","id":307},{"content_hash":"9ba80d03efd7ba315f573d0d342f5f45474c8c88a21a1e8a1588ccea27415aeb","domain":"reallygoodemails.com","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:29:01.092764+00:00","final_url":"https://reallygoodemails.com/template/international-womens-day-dance-event","language":"","text":"International Women's Day Dance Event | Email template - RGE StudioNow you have zero excuses to NOT design really good emails. Introducing RGE StudioRead more Find inspirationAll categoriesBrowse by typePopular right nowBehavioral Enhancement Inaugural Industry Miscellaneous Promotional Punctual Seasonal Templates BehavioralAbandoned CartComment NotificationCurated ContentCustomer AppreciationCustomer ServiceDiscoveryEngagementFeedback and Survey and PollFollow-UpLoyalty / RewardsPost Purchase / Recent PurchaseProduct RecommendationsReferralRetention / Re-engagementReview and TestimonialSummaryThank YouUnsubscribeCurated by humans since 2014.Browse all categoriesPopular right nowCreate emailsProductWhat is RGE StudioThe email builder t